        <mxCell id="c36" value="&lt;b&gt;SF antenna-incident-lifecycle&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;EnrichContext → PublishFirstEvent → Wait → CheckRecovery → ¿Recuperada? / ¿Prolongada? → EmitProlonged → EnsureRecoveryPublished → CloseEpisode&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;λ: enrich-context · check-recovery · emit-event · NotifyOps(SNS)&lt;/i&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FCE4EC;strokeColor=#E7157B;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#880E4F;fontSize=10;align=left;spacingLeft=8;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1">
